# Source for dist/_redirects: bin/build-dist.mjs copies it to the root of dist/ only.
# Rules here never apply to requests the Functions middleware answers, so the bare
# collection path (/<slug> -> /<slug>/) is redirected in functions/_middleware.js.
#
# armful.pages.dev -> armful.photos cannot live here: Pages _redirects does not support
# domain-level redirects ("https://armful.pages.dev/* https://armful.photos/:splat 301"
# would be ignored). Set it up once as an account Bulk Redirect instead (see DEPLOY.md):
#   source armful.pages.dev, target https://armful.photos, 301, preserve path + query.
